WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.409 --> 00:00:47.566
JUSTINE DUPONT (VOICEOVER):
[SPEAKING FRENCH]

00:00:47.566 --> 00:00:51.480
FRED DAVID: Four years
ago, we moved to Nazaré.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.325
And we decided to focus
on big wave surfing.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.700
Every big wave is different.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.000
But I think Nazaré is probably
the best place to learn

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.230
how to deal with big waves.

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:12.010
MAN: For me, surfing big
waves is totally terrifying.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:17.650
So much of the training is about
how to survive, how not to die.

00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:21.190
You have to have an
incredibly strong

00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:26.020
mind and body to face
off with these 50 or 60

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:28.900
or 70 foot waves.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.940
When the lip of
the wave crashes,

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:34.600
it can feel like a ton of bricks
smashing you into concrete.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:36.510
That's the impact zone.

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:40.920
Once you're trapped there, it's
nearly impossible to get out.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:44.010
You have to find your way to
the surface between the waves

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:46.290
and get a jet ski
driver to pick you up.

00:01:49.038 --> 00:01:52.350
FRED DAVID (VOICEOVER): Our
work is really dangerous.

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:55.320
My goal is first to have
Justine safe, second,

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.110
to find the best way for her.

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:01.430
JUSTINE DUPONT:
[SPEAKING FRENCH]

00:02:09.312 --> 00:02:11.880
FRED DAVID: In Nazaré, she
was surfing, like, every

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:13.380
swell every day, all day long.

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:15.210
And she never fell.

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:17.010
So when we got the
call for Hawaii

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:20.650
for the [INAUDIBLE] contest,
she was, like, super confident.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:25.070
She was, OK, I'm ready.

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:26.468
[CHATTER]

00:02:26.468 --> 00:02:32.472
[SPEAKING FRENCH]

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:04.280
[MUSIC PLAYING]

